{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266z9CQR5hB71794392371.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共中央政治局委員、外長王毅，在北京與古巴外長羅德里格斯會面。</p><p></p><p>王毅在釣魚台國賓館，歡迎羅德里格斯。王毅表示，世界正面臨百年未有之大變局，無論形勢如何發展，中方將堅定支持古巴維護國家主權和正當權益，反對制裁封鎖和外來干涉。</p><p></p><p>中方願同古方共同落實好兩國元首重要共識，加強多邊領域溝通協作，共同反對強權政治和單邊行徑，推動全球南方的聯合自強。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BJ.WANG-1700-1_CLEAN_20261111_175909_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026um53zyVKun1794392385.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>羅德里格斯感謝中方對古巴國家發展，特別是反對外部封鎖和干涉提供的寶貴支持。古巴始終堅定恪守一個中國原則，願同中方在多邊領域繼續加強協調取得更多合作成果。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:37:16.552854+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:17:13.069619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:40.017232+00:00","content_hash":"f15ad50fec375f7d0f118fd4a0846a9e61698a376acc705db9804fc485f9292f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:37:16.552854+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}